{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A turn-based tactical RPG where victory comes from outscoring, not eliminating your enemies. Four friends are whisked off to a fantasy realm where they must take on teams from local towns to try and find a way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958090/extras/a218e01a532ee457001ae03cd9e084af.poster.avif?t=1755620621\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958090/extras/a218e01a532ee457001ae03cd9e084af.webm?t=1755620621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958090/extras/a218e01a532ee457001ae03cd9e084af.mp4?t=1755620621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo you can enjoy the first 4 Main Quests, 4 Side Quests, and unlimited Grind Matches in the Single player <strong>Adventure Mode</strong>, as well as\u00a0unlimited Quick Multiplayer Matches against the CPU or a Friend<strong>\u00a0</strong>(<strong>Local and Remote Play Together supported</strong>).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4v4 turn-based tactical football matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal damage to opponents to force <i><strong>SUPER FUMBLES</strong></i> that fly across the field, or <i><strong>WALLOP</strong></i> them to take them out of the game for a spell!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and learn up to <strong>16 abilities</strong> across <strong>4 unique playfields</strong> in the Queendom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your team from all\u00a0<strong>8  Positions</strong>\u00a0(similar to classes or jobs in traditional RPGs) offering lots of strategic variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you make a decision that's not turning out so well? No sweat! The built-in <strong>Rewind</strong>\u00a0and <strong>Undo Move</strong> features lets you try again easily.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playfield is lovingly handcrafted with a 1990's <strong>low-poly aesthetic</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958090/extras/c31b2c97e6e0a144294e5c05d021d276.poster.avif?t=1755620621\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958090/extras/c31b2c97e6e0a144294e5c05d021d276.webm?t=1755620621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958090/extras/c31b2c97e6e0a144294e5c05d021d276.mp4?t=1755620621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drafting Your Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All units can Move, Tackle and Pitch the ball, but the real strategy comes from their distinct Position abilities. You can build any combination of players from the following 8 Positions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balancer</strong>: Healing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrower</strong>: Forward Passes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Striker</strong>: Fast Movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Caster</strong>: Ranged Magic </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blocker</strong>: Tank and Disrupt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defender</strong>: Strong Tackles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supporter</strong>: Team Buffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamebreaker</strong>: Wild Card</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958090?t=1755620621","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958090?t=1755620621","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958090/2d5aa333f3771b2ee1b43d4e46948b7b4259b82d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755620621","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958090/2d5aa333f3771b2ee1b43d4e46948b7b4259b82d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755620621","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A turn-based tactical RPG where victory comes from outscoring, not eliminating your enemies. Four friends are whisked off to a fantasy realm where they must take on teams from local towns to try and find a way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958090/extras/a218e01a532ee457001ae03cd9e084af.poster.avif?t=1755620621\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958090/extras/a218e01a532ee457001ae03cd9e084af.webm?t=1755620621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958090/extras/a218e01a532ee457001ae03cd9e084af.mp